      "body": "## What\n\nAdd `Qwen/Qwen2.5-Coder-1.5B-Instruct` to the batch invariance tested models list.\n\n## Validation\n\nRan `tests/v1/determinism/test_batch_invariance.py` on NVIDIA RTX 4090 (Ada, sm_89) with `VLLM_BATCH_INVARIANT=1`:\n\n- All 6 test variants passed (FLASH_ATTN / TRITON_ATTN / FLEX_ATTENTION × default / vllm_c RMSNorm)\n- `VLLM_USE_FLASHINFER_SAMPLER=0` used to work around a FlashInfer JIT compilation issue on AutoDL's CUDA toolkit\n\n## Related Issues\n\nFixes #27433\n\n## AI Disclosure\n\nAI assistance (Claude Code) was used during the creation of this PR. All changes have been reviewed and validated.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>",
